[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3049850804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3049850804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3049850804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61yQe0","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T18:05:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T18:05:18Z","body":"It looks like the tests failed on macOS.  I don't have a Mac to test on, but it sounds like the corresponding flag for the Apple linker is `-force_load`.  I'll try making an update to use that flag and see if the tests pass.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3049850804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050684376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3050684376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3050684376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc611b_Y","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T00:45:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T00:45:01Z","body":"This latest version appears to have succeeded everywhere except for the mingw build.  The mingw build failure looks like a pre-existing bug with module definitions in `modules/SCsub`  (I'm curious how it apparently manages to succeed currently in most builds.)\r\n\r\nFor this particular build failure, code in `scene\\resources\\svg_texture.cpp` depends on code from `modules\\svg`, but these two libraries are incorrectly listed in the wrong order in the `LIBS` variable.  Since libscene depends on libmodule_svg, it needs to be listed before libmodule_svg in `LIBS`.\r\n\r\nThe code in modules/SCsub doesn't really appear to track dependencies between modules and the other core/scene/etc libraries at all, and does not order `LIBS` correctly.  I'll take a stab at a separate PR to fix the dependency issues in modules/SCsub.  Note that this is something that SCons is generally just bad at--it does not track library dependencies at all and forces you to manually be very careful when constructing `LIBS`.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050684376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050718300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3050718300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3050718300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc611kRc","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T01:11:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T01:11:45Z","body":"> Thee code in modules/SCsub doesn't really appear to track dependencies between modules and the other core/scene/etc libraries at all, and does not order `LIBS` correctly.\r\n\r\nAh, actually I'm wrong about this: there is logic for tracking dependencies, but only between modules themselves.  The sorting just happens in the top-level SConstruct file, using code from methods.py\r\n\r\nHowever, the current code doesn't handle the fact that code in scene/, core/, and elsewhere currently also have dependencies on some modules.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050718300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3051041149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3051041149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3051041149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc612zF9","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T04:09:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T04:09:03Z","body":"Looking into the library dependencies a little more, the current library definitions seem like they have a number of circular dependencies?  The code defines separate libraries for core/, scene/, drivers/, etc, but all of these libraries depend circularly on each other.  e.g., code in core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp depends on code from scene/, code in drivers/png/resource_saver_png.cpp depends on code from scene/, etc.\r\n\r\nGiven the circular dependencies, it doesn't really seem like these should be separate libraries.  It seems like this all needs to be one big library, with modules/regex and modules/svg included too.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3051041149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052209782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3052209782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3052209782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc617QZ2","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","sit