ged to fix #108426 so that it is now a reasonable fix instead of a janky hack.\r\n\r\nThis PR does build successfully on all platforms now if rebased on top of that commit.  Let me know if there is a preferred way to manage stacked PRs: should I wait to update this one until #108426 is merged?  Is it preferable for me to squash these into a single PR?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3053912400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105147768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108415#issuecomment-3105147768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108415","id":3105147768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65FMt4","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T23:45:57Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T23:45:57Z","body":"For this pr, we're waiting for 4.5 to be released first and then the enhancements can be progressed.","au